    <p class="eyebrow">Build</p>
    <h1 class="page-head__title">How to build a <em>Canlander deck.</em></h1>
    <p class="page-head__lede">Every Canlander list answers three questions: what do your ten points buy, how does the deck win, and how do you make a hundred singletons do the same thing every game? Here's how good players answer them.</p>
  </div>
</header>

